  {"id":"FlashGetters.CanCID","unit":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCIDGetter.dll","entry":"StartGetCID","inputs":{"callbacks":"typCallBacks*; vtable slot12 cancellation/status callback (callback table+0x30, receives callbacks[0])","context":"opaque native current context; +0x754 error-code pointer, +0x758 detail-code pointer, +0x9c4 byte copied into worker","device":"CJ2534IF*","arg4":"opaque forwarded worker+8 (unused reachable business body)","parameters":"CParameter* worker+0xc","targets":"vector<packed7byte CommunicationAddress>* worker+0x10","success":"u8* out; written from Execute return"},"results":{"return":"address of module-global vector<MSVC std::string>; vector element stride24","identity":"16-byte source fields copied and NUL-terminated; first NUL truncates; skip fields whose first byte is zero; no ASCII range or checksum validation","target_assignment":"each newly appended result index <34 gets context+0x5a0+12*i = {u32 0,requestAddress.GetString(max7)}","global_address":"CCommunicationAddress::SetCanIDsFromResultOfGetCID(last successful source tuple), also before break comparison","lifetime":"Module-global vector reset on every StartGetCID call. Caller must consume/copy before another entry call; no per-call allocation returned ownership transfer."},"ordered_behavior":["Clear prior global string vector before each entry; create worker and CCanDiagCommUtils(callbacks,device).","Get ReceiveTimeoutBeforeGetCID into u32 initialized0 (ignore return); device.Connect(6); SetTimeout(value). Read RequestCANIDAllowingTimeout and RequestCANIDBreakingResponse as zero-initialized5byte char buffers.","Iterate input target vector in order, records stride7. width=2+(record[6]!=0); request=record[0:width], response=record[3:3+width]. Helpers expand CBytes to width+2 for J2534 CAN addressing.","Capability query helper starts flow-control filter, sends address||09 00, DataSize=expandedWidth+2. CanDiag args errorKind3,cancelEnabled=false,0,0x95,0xff,true,5000. Success only response.DataSize=expandedWidth+6 and (response.Data[expandedWidth+2]&0x30)!=0. Known CJ2534Exception detail9/16 caught as false; all other detail exceptions rethrow. StopFilter at common return.","If capability false: compare request address to configured RequestCANIDAllowingTimeout. If equal continue, else throw CPassThruException(enum3,source,line0xfb).","If capability true: CID helper starts flow-control filter; checks callback slot12; when false sends address||09 04, DataSize=expandedWidth+2 using errorKind3,cancelEnabled=true,0,0x95,0xff,true,5000. Parse response, then stop filter. If callback true, skip send and skip StopFilter at this local level (outer disconnect still runs).","Assign target metadata for newly appended IDs, publish successful communication tuple. If request equals RequestCANIDBreakingResponse, end loop; otherwise continue. Exhaustion or breaking response sets success=true even if vector empty.","Catch CJ2534Exception writes context+754 pointee error from exception+0xc and +758 pointee detail from+0x2c. Catch CPassThruException writes error+0xc only (detail pointee left unchanged). Catch-all writes neither. False success default. Common teardown invokes device virtual slot+8 then returns success. Entry destroys worker/diag object after normal Execute return."],"parser":{"offset":"o=8 if response.Data[5]==0x49 && response.Data[6]==0x04 else7","bounds":"DataSize>=o+16 required else CPassThru enum3 line0x25e; count=Data[o-1]; require DataSize == o+16*count else line0x265. Thus zero-count response is rejected by minimum rule.","loop":"for i in [0,count): field=Data[o+16*i:o+16*(i+1)]; copy16, set byte16 NUL; if field[0]!=0 append C-string. No hard34 cap on returned global vector; 34 only bounds target metadata writes.","positive_prefix_quirk":"Getter passes expected=null,minSize=0 to CanDiag. Parser does not require service49/04 for normal offset7; it only uses49/04 at fixed Data5/6 to choose extended offset8. Any exact-length payload meeting count/field rules follows append path; no negative-response exclusion except shared helper NRC78/21 handling."},"session_security":"No explicit session or SecurityAccess requests in this implementation. Transport protocol6 and configured addresses only.","cleanup":"Flow filters stopped locally after successful send/parse; exceptions in CID send/parser bypass local StopFilter. Outer device disconnect common unwind provides transport teardown. Callback cancellation is not represented as separate false result; described success quirk preserved.","typed_joins":[{"contract":"FlashTransport.J2534.Connect","args":["device","6"]},{"contract":"FlashTransport.J2534.SetTimeout","args":["device","u32 ReceiveTimeoutBeforeGetCID"]},{"contract":"FlashTransport.J2534.StartFlowControlFilter","args":["device","zero-left-padded request CBytes width4/5","zero-left-padded response CBytes width4/5"],"result":"u32 filterid"},{"contract":"FlashTransport.J2534.StopFilter","args":["device","u32 filterid"]},{"contract":"FlashShared.TCUWCanDiagCommUtils.SendRequMsgAndReceiveRespMsg@14a0","signature":"void thiscall(this,CBytes const&,PASSTHRU_MSG*,CBytes const&,PASSTHRU_MSG*,u32,PASSTHRU_MSG*,enmError,bool,u32,u32,u32,bool,u32)","args":["diag","reqAddress","request","respAddress","null","0","out","3","capability:false CID:true","0","0x95","0xff","true","5000"],"parameter_semantics":["sendAddress","request","receiveAddress","expectedOrNull","minimumTotalDataSize","response","errorKind","cancelEnabled","delayAfterWriteMs","maxPendingResponses","maxBusyResponses","sendTesterPresentOnPendingExhaust","pendingReadTimeoutMs"]},{"contract":"flashbackend.bytes.numeric","usage":"CBytes::SetNum(width+2) zero-left-pads2/3byte selector result to4/5; GetString(max7) for metadata"},{"contract":"flashbackend.native.compatibility","result_join":"returned vector count must equal metadata record count and exact(CID,node) same-index match; this getter synthesizes node type0 per result"},{"contract":"cuw.factory.role-load-selection","parameter_binding":"DLLFileNameForGetCID and GetCANIDFunctionNameForGetCID rows via source-bound raw/typed evidence","owner_artifact":"source-bound raw/typed evidence"}],"cancel":"Explicit pre-read callback returning nonzero skips CID send and local StopFilter. During CanDiag CID read cancelEnabled=true triggers CException which shared helper swallows after restoring timeout. Getter then parses response (potentially zero/partial) and normally rejects its size; do not treat cancellation as guaranteed thrown/false at helper boundary.","typed_exceptions":{"source":"source-bound raw/typed evidence","module":"TCUWCanCIDGetter.dll","execute":{"FuncInfoVA":"0x10004840","tryStates":"0..4","catch":"CJ2534Exception@0x10001528; CPassThruException@0x10001581; catchall@0x1000159d"},"capability":{"FuncInfoVA":"0x1000490c","tryStates":"2..2","catch":"CJ2534Exception@0x100018f5; detail9/16 suppressed, else rethrow"}},"dispatch_context":"CUW phase-vs-integrated selector first opens own routeINI; readable current499slice INIs dispatch phase irrespective masterflag0. Exact loader/version/alternate selection external owned cuw.factory.* contracts. No diagnostic InformationReads plugin association.","common_abi_contract":"FlashGetters.CommonABI","owner":"FlashGetters","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCIDGetter.dll"]},
