  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWSilDiagCommUtils.FastInit@1100","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWSilDiagCommUtils.dll","rva":"0x1100","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["u8 target","u8 source","CSilDiagCommUtils::enmComm comm"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Ioctl virtual+0x0c(2,config list Parameter0x14 Value=(comm==1?35:25),NULL); then ioctl2 config Parameter0x15 Value50.","Zero request and response; create request Data=[81,target,source,81,CalcCheckSum(first h+1 bytes)] with h=global headerLen, hardcode DataSize5. No validation that global h is3 here.","Ioctl virtual+0x0c(5,&request,&response). If GetIndicationFromRxStatus(response.RxStatus)!=3, zero a fresh message/count1 and WrapReadMsgs once; otherwise skip additional read. No expected reply comparison/retry/cancel here."],"checksum_join":{"contract":"flashbackend.bytes.checksum-endian","formula":"sum(transmitted bytes before checksum) mod256; not a receive checksum predicate"},"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWSilDiagCommUtils.dll"]},
