  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.CheckFinishReprogramming@1390","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x1390","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["h=sendAddress.length; zero frame; TxFlags80 iff h5; copy h sendAddress bytes; append3e,DataSize=h+1; WriteMsgs1.","Zero response,count1; ReadSpecifiedCanMsg(receiveAddress,response,&count,frame0). ANY returned selected frame counts as success: no size/service/positive-response comparison. CJ2534 caught and rethrown unchanged."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.FinishReprogramming@1ce0","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x1ce0","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes* receiveAddressOrNull"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Zero frame; copy sendAddress[0:4] unconditionally. If sendAddress.length==5, copy fifth byte and OR TxFlags80. Put80 at Data[sendAddress.length]; set DataSize=length+1; WriteMsgs1.","If receiveAddress nonnull call ReceiveAck;false ->CPassThruError23. Null skips receive entirely; caller owns follow-up finish detection. CJ2534 context23 and rethrow. No field/range checks on address length."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
