  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.GetStatus@2100","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x2100","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","bool retryPassThruExceptions"],"result":"u8 in AL","ordered_behavior":["Call GetStatusOnce. Catch ONLY CPassThruException, not catchall. If retry=false allow1 attempt; if true allow4 total attempts (3 additional), then rethrow final exception unchanged. No delay/reset/timeout change between attempts."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.CheckIDWithWaitOfSFs@1510","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x1510","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","const char* locationIDHex","u32 password","u32 delayBetweenSingleFramesMs","u32 timeoutBeforeInitialCommandMs","bool bigEndianFlag"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Construct CBytes(locationIDHex), assign into local location; any exception from conversion becomes CPassThruError9. Construct CBytes(password). If bigEndianFlag call location.ConvEndian(2),password.ConvEndian(0); byte-order algorithms belong Backend CBytes.","Construct FIVE raw frames, each starts sendAddress[0:4]. Payloads in order: [00],[00],[location[7],location[6],location[3],location[2],location[1],location[0]],[location[5],location[4]],[passwordBytes[3],passwordBytes[2],passwordBytes[1],passwordBytes[0]]. Total DataSizes5,5,10,6,8. No address/converted-location/password length guards.","Write each frame individually,count1. Sleep(delayBetweenSingleFramesMs) after frames0..3 only. ReceiveAck musttrue elseerror7.","If timeoutBeforeInitialCommandMs!=0 SetTimeout(that value) and DO NOT restore it in this method. Zero response,count1; ReadSpecifiedCanMsg(receiveAddress,frame,count1,frame1); returned frame not inspected.","Write sendAddress[0:4]+[3c],DataSize5. No trailing ReceiveAck. Destroy temporary CBytes. CJ2534 context7 and rethrow."],"state_ownership":{"transport_timeout":"Shared CJ2534IF timeout intentionally persists on this path."},"byte_template_closure":{"location_input":"Let L be8 parsed location bytes BEFORE endian conversion (no sizeguard).","bigEndianFlag_false":{"frame2_payload":"[L7,L6,L3,L2,L1,L0]","frame3_payload":"[L5,L4]","password_frame":"LE32(password)"},"bigEndianFlag_true":{"frame2_payload":"[L6,L7,L2,L3,L0,L1]","frame3_payload":"[L4,L5]","password_frame":"BE32(password)"},"authority":"source-bound raw/typed evidence flashbackend.bytes.storage,flashbackend.bytes.checksum-endian"},"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.GetMemoryInfo@1e40","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x1e40","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","typMemoryInfo& geometryOut (12 bytes)","bool* usedExtendedCommandOut (nonnull in body)","bool extendedResponseHasExtraTwoBytes"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Write sendAddress[0:4]+[76],DataSize5; ReceiveAck. On false write same prefix+[75],DataSize5; ReceiveAck false ->errorA. Write *usedExtendedCommandOut=true for76 success,false for75 fallback BEFORE receiving geometry.","ReadSpecifiedCanMsg(receiveAddress,response,count1,frame1). For76 require DataSize==13+2*extendedResponseHasExtraTwoBytes; for75 require DataSize==12. Equality, not minimum.","Construct CBytes from response.Data+4, count=(DataSize-(usedExtended?5:4)); call owned CFlashWriterUtils.ExtractMemoryInfoFromBytes and copy12 bytes result into geometryOut. Extended branch omits one final response byte; legacy consumes all bytes after four-byte address. Exact parsing belongs FlashShared parent FlashWriterUtils.","ReceiveAck musttrue elseerrorA AFTER geometryOut has already been mutated. CJ2534 contextA and rethrow. No restore of either output on failure."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.CheckBlock@11d0","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x11d0","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","CParameter& parameters","const typBlockRange& range (u32 first,last)","bool extended16BitRange"],"result":"bool in AL","ordered_behavior":["Build raw frame prefix sendAddress[0:4]. If extended=false payload=[35,u8(range.first-1)],DataSize6 (range.last ignored). If true payload=[36,BE16(range.first-1),BE16(range.last-1)],DataSize9; all arithmetic wraps/truncates with no validation.","Write1; ReceiveAck false ->errorB. GetParameterlong(\"WaitTimeBeforeStatusCheckForBlankCheck\",localInitially0),ignore bool.","Loop Sleep(waitMs); status=GetStatus(send,receive,true); while status==10 repeat. Return(status==0); all other statuses return false rather than throw. CJ2534 contextB."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.EraseBlock@1af0","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x1af0","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","const typBlockRange& range","CParameter& parameters","bool extended16BitRange"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Raw frame prefix send[0:4]. Short payload=[25,u8(range.first-1)] size6; extended=[26,BE16(first-1),BE16(last-1)] size9. No range validation.","Write1; ReceiveAck false ->errorc. Read parameter \"WaitTimeBeforeStatusCheckForEraseBlock\" into long initially0; ignore lookup bool.","Loop Sleep(wait); GetStatus(send,receive,true); busy iff status!=0 && (status&0x0f)==0; status0 succeeds; any other nonbusy status throws errorc. CJ2534 contextual errorc."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
