  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.SendNonceAndSeedKey@2920","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x2920","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","const u8* nonce16","const u8* key16","u32 delayBetweenFramesMs"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["Six frames: prefix4+[37,nonce0:6],+[38,nonce6:12],+[39,nonce12:16],+[3a,key0:6],+[3b,key6:12],+[3c,key12:16]. Total sizes11,11,9,11,11,9; Write1 and Sleep after first FIVE only. Single ReceiveAck at end required;falseerror48; CJ2534 context48. No cryptography performed here."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.IsFinishReprogramming@24d0","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x24d0","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["std::vector<std::vector<CCommunicationAddress::typCommunicationAddress>>* addresses"],"result":"bool in AL","ordered_behavior":["Dereference outer.begin then first inner.begin WITHOUT emptiness/null checks. First address record byte6!=0 selects compact header length3,else2. Construct send CBytes(record+0,length),receive CBytes(record+3,length); SetNum(length+2) on each, delegating zero-extension semantics to Backend CBytes.","StartFlowControlFilter(send,receive); mark acquired; CheckFinishReprogramming(send,receive); if that returns setresulttrue. Any exception during filter/start/check is caught(...) and swallowed (result false unless check alreadycompleted).","If acquired StopFilter(filterID). Any exception from StopFilter itself swallowed independently. Destroy temporaries; return result. A successfully received selected frame in CheckFinish is the whole success predicate; no explicit positive ECU state byte checked."],"expanded_address_templates":"SetNum adds LEFT zeros: record.byte6==0 =>send[00,00,record0,record1],receive[00,00,record3,record4]; byte6!=0 =>send[00,00,record0,record1,record2],receive[00,00,record3,record4,record5].","owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
  {"id":"FlashShared.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.VerifyBlock2@2d30","unit_id":"flashing.pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll","rva":"0x2d30","calling_convention":"x86 __thiscall; ECX=this; each explicit stack slot 4 bytes; bool/u8 inputs consumed as low byte","inputs":["const CBytes& sendAddress","const CBytes& receiveAddress","u32 index","const typBlockRange& range","const std::vector<u32>& blockSizes","const char* image","i32 imageLength","CParameter& parameters","u32* transferredCounters","u32* progressPercent"],"result":"void","ordered_behavior":["offset=sum_u32(blockSizes[0:range.first-1]); total=(range.last-range.first+1)*blockSizes[range.first-1] modulo32. No empty/range/bounds/heterogeneous-block-size validation; block index is1-based.","Send command prefix4+[18,BE16(first-1),BE16(last-1)],DataSize9; require ReceiveAck elseerrorF. ChunkSize128,DataSize132.","After command and ACK, GetParameterlong(\"WaitTimeBeforeStatusCheckForVerify\",waitInitially0), ignore bool. Send fixed-size data chunks prefix4+image[offset+done:offset+done+chunkSize], with NO clipping/padding/bounds check for final chunk.","After each data Write increment done and transferredCounters[index] by chunkSize; callbacks+28(context); write progressPercent[index]=low32(truncTowardZero(unsigned_u32(transferredCounters[index]) / signed_i32(2*imageLength) *100.0)); callbacks+2c(context). These callbacks bracket updates, not cancellation requests; no local+30 cancel poll.","Require ReceiveAck after each chunk elseerrorF. Sleep(wait); GetStatus(send,receive,done==total). Status0 ->next chunk; nonzero status with lowNibble0 ->Sleep/poll again; otherwiseerrorF.","Inner CPassThruException from status polling is swallowed ONLY when done!=total; prior status initialized0 then continues next chunk. At exact last chunk rethrow into outer handler. Outer CJ2534 relabeledF/rethrow same type; outer CPassThru replaced by fresh CPassThruErrorF. No WritingErrorDispose or progress rollback here."],"owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.TCUWCanCommonFlashWriter.dll"]},
