  {"unit_id":"flashing.pe.YamlDotNet.dll","contract_id":"flashshared.support.yaml","behavior":["CUW ConfigReader.Parse(string) creates StringReader, constructs Deserializer(), calls Deserialize<Cuw.Config.Config>(TextReader), finally disposes StringReader, returns config. ReadConfig first decrypts with supplied passphrase path and comments Editor-header. Parse/decryption exceptions propagate to caller; no schema recovery/fallback invented.","Other canonical callers use YamlStream.Load/Documents/RootNode/YamlMappingNode.Children, scalar values, DeserializerBuilder.WithNamingConvention/Build and YamlMember aliases. Exact source-qualified calls and attribute blobs retained; YAML selection belongs configuration/Backend, not ECU algorithm."],"transitive_runtime_bindings":[],"native_import_bindings_ref":{"artifact":"source-bound raw/typed evidence","collection":"native_import_bindings","library":"YamlDotNet.dll"},"id":"flashshared.support.yaml","owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.YamlDotNet.dll"]},
  {"unit_id":"flashing.pe.log4net.dll","contract_id":"flashshared.support.log4net","behavior":["Application uses LogManager.GetLogger and ILog Debug/Info/Warn/Error plus Format variants and IsDebugEnabled/IsInfoEnabled gates; concrete log implementation entry bodies and caller argument-producing IL retained. These consume messages/status/error codes; they do not reinterpret native result values.","CUW backend assembly XmlConfiguratorAttribute sets ConfigFile=conf\\backendlogconfig.xml and Watch=true (attribute blob retained), so configuration can load via attribute rather than explicit Configure call. Main/auxiliary assembly attribute bindings are source-qualified. Framework appender/configuration algorithms are not ECU communication."],"transitive_runtime_bindings":[],"native_import_bindings_ref":{"artifact":"source-bound raw/typed evidence","collection":"native_import_bindings","library":"log4net.dll"},"id":"flashshared.support.log4net","owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.log4net.dll"]},
  {"unit_id":"flashing.pe.msvcp140.dll","contract_id":"flashshared.support.msvcp","behavior":["Current native CUW callers concretely bind std C++ stream/locale/codecvt functions: basic_istream.read/seekg/gcount, basic_ostream.write/flush, streambuf get/put pointers and xsgetn/xsputn, ios good/fail/eof/clear, locale/time_get/time_put, _Fiopen, and _Xbad_alloc/_Xinvalid_argument/_Xlength_error/_Xout_of_range/_Xruntime_error. Decorated names retain MSVC ABI types, thiscall/cdecl and widths.","69 actually observed direct-IAT call symbol encodings are recorded with source SHA/RVA/exact FF15 bytes; complete per-PE native import bindings include thunk-only/tailcall targets. The application caller owns filenames, offsets, sizes, errors and ECU conversions; this CRT supplies streams, formatting, allocation failures and locale functions. Byte-occurrence evidence is explicitly not a recovered enclosing-function attribution."],"transitive_runtime_bindings":[],"native_import_bindings_ref":{"artifact":"source-bound raw/typed evidence","collection":"native_import_bindings","library":"msvcp140.dll"},"id":"flashshared.support.msvcp","owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.msvcp140.dll"]},
  {"unit_id":"flashing.pe.vcruntime140.dll","contract_id":"flashshared.support.vcruntime","behavior":["Native CUW direct-IAT encodings concretely call __std_exception_copy, __std_exception_destroy and strstr; complete native import bindings retain additional exception/unwind/runtime support reached through compiler thunks. These implement exception object lifetime and substring search at the application call boundary, not ECU parsing policies.","Each concrete instruction has exact current caller SHA/RVA/IAT symbol bytes. Runtime target-export prefixes and current target binary SHA pin the imported library. Application buffer validity/needle/data interpretation stays with the recovered caller, not an invented vcruntime state machine."],"transitive_runtime_bindings":[],"native_import_bindings_ref":{"artifact":"source-bound raw/typed evidence","collection":"native_import_bindings","library":"vcruntime140.dll"},"id":"flashshared.support.vcruntime","owner":"FlashShared","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.vcruntime140.dll"]},
