  {"id":"security.application-authentication-manager","inputs":{"authenticationCode":"string arg1","challengeCode":"string arg2","packagedSalts":"ordered5 fixed salt strings; withheld"},"result":"AMResultEntity {Result:bool,ErrorCode:string?,Value:string?}","formula":"CreateChallengeCode ->Base64(Guid.NewGuid().ToByteArray(),Base64FormattingOptions.None). CheckAuthentication iterates each packaged salt independently; expected=HEX_UPPER(SHA256(UTF8(challengeCode+salt))). Compare expected ==authenticationCode.ToUpper() (current culture). Clear builder between salts. Firstmatch setsResulttrue,ErrorCodenull; Value remainsnull. No decoded Base64 challenge processing or server request.","errors":"Initial Resultfalse,ErrorCode AM0100,Valuenull; catch->AM9999; success ErrorCodenull. Hashprovider and enumerator disposed. No cache/replay/expiry here.","joins":["PlatformSession caller must supply storedchallenge and consume only according to its own state machine; this helper alone is not ECU/SSO/gateway authentication."],"owner":"Security","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.GTSPlus/bin/GtsPlus-AuthenticationManager.dll"]},
  {"id":"security.native-authentication-hmac","source":{"path":"build/out/gts-all-unprotected/GTSPlus/bin/GTSPlusFileCryptographic.dll"},"inputs":{"data":"const uint8_t* input","length":"int32 bytecount","result":"out wchar_t* heapowned NULterminated64hexchars","key":"embedded45byte packaging key at RVA31C8; bytes omitted"},"result":"int32 NTSTATUS-like:0success,negative BCrypt status on failure,-1 heapallocation failure; native new[] may throw","formula":"HMAC_SHA256(Kpack45bytes,input[0:length]); uppercase HEX with perbyte wideformat %02X, then managedlowercase. Not plain SHA256.","ordered":["Export1610 forwardsECX=data,EDX=length plus keyptr,keylen45,outptr to1630","BCryptOpenAlgorithmProvider(SHA256,null,flags8). Negative ->return status (output not initialized by this function)","GetProperty ObjectLength and HashDigestLength, HeapAlloc hashobject and digest, negative status->close/free acquired objects; failedHeapAlloc ->-1","BCryptCreateHash(alg,object,key45,flags0); negative closesalg,freesbuffers. BCryptHashData/FinishHash negative closesalg then destroys hash then freesbuffers","Allocate wchar_t[2*digestLength+1],zero allbytes; for each digestbyte format%02X at charoffset2*i; write output pointer","Success cleanup exact order: BCryptCloseAlgorithmProvider then BCryptDestroyHash then HeapFree(hashobject) then HeapFree(digest),return0","FreeMemory RVA1900 tailjumps CRT delete[]. Managed frees only normal success, not in finally."],"cancel":"No cancellation or account/live secret fetch. Provisioned server acceptance not asserted.","body_pin_note":"Legacy576byte body pin c6eb...dca34 covers1630..186F and truncates live output/cleanup. Complete actual body1630..18F7 (712bytes) retained here.","owner":"Security","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-pe.GTSPlus/bin/GTSPlusFileCryptographic.dll"]},
