  {"id":"FlashingFrontend.hino-controller.executeCuwPlusFunc","unit_id":"flashing.external-caller.hino-controller","method":"executeCuwPlusFunc","entry_admission_input_domain":"controller,initFlag; Hino model.selectedEcuInfo & download metadata","state_fields":"showDl011,win,cuwResponseCode,timer1","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Open busy loader then blank popup; first pagehide creates1000ms async interval.","initFlag true awaits prepareForCuwPlusLaunch then launch; catch marks showDl011 if popup, closes popup, closes loader, awaitsDL011;isExit opens loader then executeInfProcess. false bypasses preparation.","Launch relative ../cuw/CUWMain.html?P5=cuwFileList.json&P4=GTS (not P3). Register result callback; stopWaitCuwResponsee before awaiting val; capture data.data.returnValue.","On win.closed clear interval; showDl011 suppresses result processing.0->await executeInfProcess.1->close loader then DL012: isYes opens loader and recursively retryfalse;else opens loader and executeInfProcess. Missing/other->DL013: isOk opens loader and recursively retryfalse.","executeInfProcess:await generateSendInfFile(controller,false);log r_item_i7196;close loader->S005;catch close loader->backPreviousScreen.","Async method resolves after launch preparation, not after popup interval business."],"request_construction":{"url":"P5=cuwFileList.json&P4=GTS","relay":"data.data.returnValue","generateSendInfFile":["controller",false]},"response_error_mapping":"No timeout/pop-up-null guard. Interval async exceptions outside executeInfProcess/recursive method are unhandled here.","user_visible_result":"Hino-specific INF continuation on normal OR cancel-user-continue OR already-running Exit.","mutation_cleanup_cancel_semantics":"Cannot substitute ordinary P3 caller or assume response alone finishes. Platform/Hino preparation and INF business owners retain actual backend effects.","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.gts.js/gts/ecu_search_for_hino/ecu_search_for_hino_controller.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.connect@4009","member":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js","span":[4009,7214],"semantics":"CUW singleton socket scan; Firefox serial2sec per port, others race success with10sec timeout. Handshake sends GetPlatformName {requestId,commandName,parameter:{}} and accepts result.pfName===CUW without a resultCode check. Winning socket installed; timed-out losing sockets close. Errors yield CONNECTION_HANDSHAKE only if list contains handShakeError (no visible producer of that enum here), otherwise CONNECTION_REFUSED. Pending requests are not rejected on close.","id":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.connect@4009","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.send@7315","member":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js","span":[7315,7886],"semantics":"Allocates deferred indexed by Date.now()%1e10, spins generating IDs on collision, sends JSON {requestId,commandName,parameter:param===undefined?{}:param}; returns deferred. No timeout or connection precheck; send throw occurs after map insertion.","id":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.send@7315","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.onMessage@7914","member":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js","span":[7914,8525],"semantics":"Parses JSON, decimal requestId, looks up request deferred; missing request logs/returns. resultCode===0 resolves response.result, otherwise rejects whole response; then deletes map entry. Does not inspect result.returnValue.","id":"js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js::CuwApi.prototype.onMessage@7914","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/cuw_api.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/cuw_utility.js::cuw.util.EventDispatcher@3291","member":"js/cuw/common/cuw_utility.js","span":[3291,4050],"semantics":"Each event key maps ordered callback list; trigger creates CustomEvent (IE11 legacy path), copies arguments and replaces args[0] with event, attaches same args to detail and .args, schedules each listener independently setTimeout0, and returns undefined. Undefined type is not specially rejected; map lookup uses undefined property key. dispose clears map; removeEvents empties one list.","id":"js/cuw/common/cuw_utility.js::cuw.util.EventDispatcher@3291","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-utility"]},
