  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.SendMessageForUtility@6900","member":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js","span":[6900,11271],"semantics":"Calls raw sendMessage; fulfillment validates echoed subfunction/DID bytes by requested SID (21/30/3B/11/19/22/2E/2F/31/3E; A6 no echo validation), but does not validate positive-response SID. SID11 predicate parses as (resBody[1]!==reqBody[1]) &0x7f, not masked request comparison. Rejection normalizes undefined body=>OTHER_ERROR, empty=>NO_RESPONSE, undefined/7F mode=>NEGATIVE_RESPONSE, wrong positive SID=>ABNOMAL_RESPONSE, else OTHER_ERROR, preserving original response.","id":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.SendMessageForUtility@6900","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.executeGenWebServiceSecondaryLogin@11307","member":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js","span":[11307,12807],"semantics":"One raw service attempt; extracts XML statusCode or JSON top/commonResult statusCode; only suffix4010002 plus available SSO URL triggers interactive login. Unescapes five XML entities; successful login retries raw call exactly once; canceled/failed login resolves original service response. Service rejection is not caught by this helper.","id":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.executeGenWebServiceSecondaryLogin@11307","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.startLoginProcess@13693","member":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js","span":[13693,14937],"semantics":"Informational dialog then1024x768 named login popup; registers certification broadcast and polls500ms; resolves certification or rejects closed window. Finally unregisters broadcast, clears timer, closes popup and loader.","id":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.startLoginProcess@13693","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.parseResponse@16572","member":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js","span":[16572,17476],"semantics":"XML wraps dummy root then collects commonResult/apiResult child element text; JSON uses JSON.parse. Returns resolved parsed object; parsing failures can throw before Promise.resolve.","id":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.parseResponse@16572","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.checkJsonFormat@18008","member":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js","span":[18008,19132],"semantics":"Rejects undefined root, unknown keys, missing required keys and nonarray/nonobject containers; recursively checks child schemas. Does not validate primitive leaf value types/content. Optional array schema without child may fail when present nonempty (child format undefined).","id":"js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js::gts.util.checkJsonFormat@18008","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/common/gts_utility.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.init@1390","member":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js","span":[1390,5319],"semantics":"Loads settings and offline license; stores license status, expiration info only status0; obtains current profile. Existing truthy/nonempty user ID emits loggedIn immediately. Otherwise Japanese/English EULA version gating then network/licensing mode selection: network1 online, offline license0 offline, else dialog allowing online or-1. Online screen call is not returned in mode1 branch. Errors WINDOW_CLOSED propagate; others map/show common error and reject.","id":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.init@1390","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js"]},
