  {"contract":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.onlineLoginProcess@11041","member":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js","span":[11041,15602],"semantics":"Mutates/saves country and affiliate; obtains auth URL or closes/loading error dialog and rejects WINDOW_CLOSED. Opens login window, subscribes certification broadcast, polls500ms until certified or closed; finally closes popup/loader, unregisters and clears timer. Independent dealer GENERAL_USER_USE_ONLINE bypasses license check and selects GuestUser; otherwise online license check/-1/-2 dialogs, expiration warnings, login identity and profile. Missing profile creates only when standAloneStartupFlgtrue; otherwise dialog-close rejection. Existing incomplete profile fails launch; complete profile applies config. Stores loginMode1/shared storage1; final loader cleanup occurs for post-auth processing.","id":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.onlineLoginProcess@11041","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js"]},
  {"contract":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.offlineLoginProcess@15649","member":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js","span":[15649,17023],"semantics":"Fetches requested offline profile or FAILED_RETRIEVE_USER, applies subset config, sets loginMode2/shared storage2, optionally warns using offlineExpirationDate. Preserves unusual condition (!offlineExpirationDate || offlineExpirationDate!==empty), so any nonempty date and falsy/null values enter date parsing.","id":"js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js::LoginController.prototype.offlineLoginProcess@15649","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.cuw.js/cuw/controllers/login_controller.js"]},
