  {"id":"FlashingFrontend.upgrade.upgrade_model.updateS001ViewData","member":"js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js","method":"updateS001ViewData","entry_admission_input_domain":"selectedRowMap object,optional tableIndex,rowId; existing s001ViewData/updateList; model.selectedRowMap","state_fields":"s001ViewData.selectedNum/updateList/updateSummaryList;selectedRowMap;selectedSystemList;selectedRowList;sync view row selection","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Set selectedNum0;posKey=tableIndex and rowId both!==undefined ? tableIndex+underscore+rowId+underscore : __. Iterate existing selectedRowMap keys:only prefix posKey. For prior row syncReproInfoIndex!==undefined,clear isSelected on all updateList same index;delete prefixed map entries.","Parse ALL incoming selectedRowMap key third underscore component Number->ecuList. For updateList ECU in ecuList clear isSelected; if syncReproInfoIndex>=0 clear every updateList same sync index. Remove all existing map entries whose parsed ECU is in incoming ecuList,even different prefix.","Copy only incoming keys prefix posKey into model.selectedRowMap. Rebind local selectedRowMap to model map. Iterate updateList:key=1_suNo_ecuId;only prefix posKey;clear isSelected;for mapped rows matching suNo select elm and collect defined syncReproInfoIndex. Then select ALL updateList with collected sync indexes.","Build updateSummaryList in source order grouped by dispSuNo=(suNo falsy ? commonInfo.getEcuName(Number(ecuId)) : suNo). target name swNo for empty suNo else suName. First entry projects ecuId Number,suNo,dispSuNo,name,Number latestFlg/suType,isSelected false,cannotUpdate Number(distOperationFlg)===1,cannotSelect false,syncReproInfoIndex,swNoList:[info],isUpdate true,index,isEmptySuNo. Later group append info and OR cannotUpdate. Set group.isSelected=any child isSelected.","For every mapped selected row with defined sync index,iterate model.s002ViewData.syncReproInfoMap other keys;every matching sync row:if target map absent set tgtRow.isSelected true and map=[tgtRow];else append only if no same suNo,mark true. These mutate shared row objects,not clones.","Reset selectedSystemList/selectedRowList;iterate final map keys:push commonInfo ECU name per key (no dedup),push every row;for each row.swNoList count every elm.isSelected && elm.fileName into selectedNum. No global dedup."],"request_construction":{"view_update":"local state only;selected rows later sent to worker.checkLocalStorage"},"response_error_mapping":"No catch;malformed selection key/row/schema can throw; access s002ViewData only when selected sync row branch reached.","user_visible_result":"Coordinated ECU/synchronous software selections and selected count.","mutation_cleanup_cancel_semantics":"Mutates shared source response and detailed row references;empty incoming map with default prefix __ does not clear arbitrary nonprefixed selections.","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.gts.js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js"]},
  {"id":"FlashingFrontend.upgrade.upgrade_model.makeS002ViewData","member":"js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js","method":"makeS002ViewData","entry_admission_input_domain":"rowData incl ecuId,isBlankEcu,index,suNo,isUpdate;tableIndex","state_fields":"model.s002ViewData={ecuId,syncReproInfoMap,tableIndex,rowId}","guarded_ordered_transitions":["ecuId=Number(rowData.ecuId);rowId=isBlankEcu?index:suNo;reset detail map. suNoList contains rowData.suNo ONLY if rowData.isUpdate truthy.","Filter updateList by Number ECU===target and suNo included;group by raw ecuId_suNo;append swNoList or create {ecuId:Number,suNo,name:suName,latestFlg:Number,restoreFlg:Number,suType:Number,isSelected,syncReproInfoIndex,swNoList}. Store primary viewData under tableIndex_rowId_ecuId,with ECU name and currentCidList=cidListMap[ecuId]||[].","For each target group with defined sync index not previously visited,iterate all updateList entries other ECU with exactly same index. Create/find per-ECU detail view under same tableIndex,rowId;group sync ECU rows by raw ecuId_suNo using shared suNoMap and append/create same projection.","Independently group other ECU rows whose suNo in suNoList. For each group require included suNo,existing index map and !(syncReproInfoIndex>=0). Add to per-ECU sync detail map (create currentCID/name or append) even if negative/undefined sync index.","Return model.s002ViewData directly. No sort/dedup beyond maps; raw equality for suNo and index retained."],"request_construction":{},"response_error_mapping":"No catch;property/schema errors propagate.","user_visible_result":"Detail rows for selected software plus linked ECU update groups.","mutation_cleanup_cancel_semantics":"Reference reuse of swNo records;fresh group arrays;no worker call or physical action.","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.gts.js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js"]},
  {"id":"FlashingFrontend.upgrade.upgrade_model.makeS003ViewData","member":"js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js","method":"makeS003ViewData","entry_admission_input_domain":"getSelectedRowList() default[];model.s001ViewData.calFilePath","state_fields":"s003ViewData={path,rowList:[],swNoList:[]}","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Iterate selected rows then swNoList in source order. Include software if fileEntityFlg===string0 OR downloadFlg===string0. For each derive system=getEcuName(Number(row.ecuId));append original swNo object and {index:monotone counter,system,fileName}.","Return direct model.s003ViewData;no dedupe and no additional isSelected check."],"request_construction":{},"response_error_mapping":"No catch.","user_visible_result":"Missing/download list and output file path.","mutation_cleanup_cancel_semantics":"Mutates cached view-data;not filesystem IO here.","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.flash-ui.gts.js/gts/upgrade/upgrade_model.js"]},
