  {"index":191,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.initViewS70174","inputs":"recoveryData.","state_reads":"model.destinationArea.","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Await getReceivedCIDForRecovery(destinationArea); set beforeCidList=result.receivedCIDs; viewParam={recoveryInfo:recoveryData,cidInfo:result}; numOfCpu=recoveryData.calibrationInfo.cpuNum + result.receivedCIDs.length.","Construct ViewS70174; RETRY bound onClickS70174RetryBtn(controller,numOfCpu), CANCEL onClickS70174CancelBtn(controller), DELETE onClickS70174DeleteBtn(controller); disposeSettingView; return init(viewParam)."],"promise_and_return":"Returns acquisition and init chain.","errors":"No catch.","visible_effects":"S70174 recovery choice.","state_mutations":"beforeCidList.","cancel_and_cleanup":"CANCEL/DELETE semantics delegated to callbacks.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":179882,"end_exclusive":180754,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.initViewS70174","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.initViewS70174","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
  {"index":192,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.initViewS70126","inputs":"rewriteTargetList,beforeCidList,afterCidList (passed through to final view).","state_reads":"standAloneStartupFlg; kindOfCentralGW/security; dtcClearSkippedEcuIds; Subaru settings; equipped ECU list/P4 format; vin; appName; commonInfo.vehicleConfirmation.oemDecisionInfo; isRecovery.","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Initialize repInfo={isFlashSuccess:true}, repReport={isFlashSuccess:true}. Choose vehicleInfoXmlDir base getSendVehicleInfoJSONFolderPath(), overridden for truthy vehicleConfirmation.oemDecisionInfo===1/2 by _oem1/_oem2 folder getters. Initialize filePath='', quickDtcCheckInfo={}; synchronously currentView.updateProcess(CLEAR_DTC).","Promise.resolve().then: standalone OR (SUZUKI && !security) skips clearDTC and resolves undefined. Otherwise await model.clearDTC().","If clearDtcResult?.isVehicleConfirmedErr: get CONFIG_KEY_REQUIRED_VEHICLE_CONFIRMED; only value==='true' awaits viewEndCuw.showDialogS701125() and returns S701125 Next createReproLog; finally always updateProcess(SEND_DATA) and reject({isSkipSendVehicleInfo:true}), even if config/dialog failed.","If no confirmation error and dtcClearSkippedEcuIds.length>0: await viewAfterRecv.showDialogS701137(); fire S701137 Next log; await model.clearDTCException(); return original clearDtcResult. Otherwise retain original clearDtcResult.","Then quickDtcCheckInfo=result (possibly undefined from skip); updateProcess(SEND_DATA); await CONFIG_KEY_REQUIRE_SAVE_VEHICLE_INFO.","Only requireSaveResult.value==='true' && (gateway!==SUZUKI || security) enters traceability generation. Otherwise resolve. Generate local YYYYMMDDhhmmss timestamp with 2-digit month/day/hour/min/sec, getGUISharedParameter(3); if strictly '1', set model.is19PFVer3=true; await getEquippedEcuList(), ecuGrpList=result.apiArgs.ecuGroupList.","Admission: literal if(1===0) branch is unreachable. Subaru format with existsWsSettingsForSubaru() admits. Else containsEcu([372,397,636,6000,6026,6500,6526,5043,443]) OR nonFieldFixFlag admits. Else if containsEcu([60,236]), find ecu60 group/bus and checkPartNumberFormatForP4(groupId60,60,busId60); expected result bypasses ECU236, otherwise find236 and checkPartNumberFormatForP4(groupId236,236,busId236). Next result.isExpectedFormat admits, otherwise reject; P4-chain catch rejects {isSkipSendVehicleInfo:true}. All other ECU configurations reject same skip object.","On admission: literal if(1===0) is dead. Subaru settings branch returns sendVehicleForSbr(ecuGrpList). Else containsEcu([8502]) selects A32: getSendVehicleJsonFolderPathA32(); filePath=folder+'\\V_'+vin+'_'+ts+'.json'; await writeVehicleInformationForA32(filePath,ecuGrpList,ts); return sendVehicleInfoForA32(). Otherwise AISAC2 filePath=selectedVehicleFolder+'\\V_'+vin+'_'+ts+'.json'; vinNo=model.vin.padEnd(17,' '); await writeVehicleInformationForAisac2(filePath,ecuGrpList,vinNo); return sendVehicleInfo(filePath,vinNo).","Catch through traceability/clear/config segment: errInfo?.isSkipSendVehicleInfo resolves; all other errors rethrow. Thus confirmation-error sentinel skips traceability yet continues success reporting and cleanup.","Await sendInfoAfterReprogramming(repInfo); await sendReprogrammingReport(repReport); await clearStatusOfReprogramming(false). Require result.returnValue===SUCCESS or reject. Await cancelingSleepMode(), clearServerData(). If appName!=='', await sendResponseSoftwareAsAPart(CuwModel.SendValue.NORMAL), else resolve. Await apiExclusiveControlUnlock(); sendLogoutControl(false).","Construct ViewS70126. isDoQuickDtcCheck=quickDtcCheckInfo?.isQuickDtcCheckNeeds && !commonInfo.isRecovery (may be undefined, not coerced). If truthy, FINISH binds onClickS70126ReadingOutDtcBtn(controller,quickDtcCheckInfo.url); otherwise FINISH onClickS70126FinishBtn(controller). PRINT onClickS70126PrintBtn(controller). Dispose current view; return init(rewriteTargetList,beforeCidList,afterCidList,model.appName,isDoQuickDtcCheck,model.calfileHeaderInfo.calibrationInfo)."],"promise_and_return":"Returns full chain including final view init and ordered reports/cleanup.","errors":"Only tagged isSkipSendVehicleInfo errors are swallowed. Remaining failures reject and skip subsequent steps; no overall catch/finally. Earlier synchronous folder selection/updateProcess can throw before chain construction.","visible_effects":"S701125 confirmation error or S701137 skipped-clear warning; progress CLEAR_DTC then SEND_DATA; final S70126.","state_mutations":"is19PFVer3 set true only on '1'; generated traceability files through helper calls.","cancel_and_cleanup":"Success cleanup ordered after both reports; status clear validated before sleep/server/normal response/unlock/logout. No disconnect here; final Finish handles terminal cleanup.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":180754,"end_exclusive":188613,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.initViewS70126","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.initViewS70126","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
  {"index":193,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.sendVehicleInfo","inputs":"currentFilePath,vinNo.","state_reads":"loginMode, appName, productInfo, base/OEM AISAC and AISAC2 settings.","guarded_ordered_transitions":["If loginMode===2 or model.appName truthy resolve immediately. Else oemDecisionInfoManual=-1; await getSendVehicleJsonFolderPathList().","Build serialized folder promise chain with forEach. Empty folder path sets shared oemDecisionInfoManual=0 synchronously during chain construction and does not append work. For each nonempty folder append .then: if manual===-1 choose base settings, manual=0; else DS4 chooses oem1/manual1, GTS chooses oem2/manual2, other product chooses base/manual0. This shared variable may already be changed by an empty later folder before queued callbacks run.","Skip folder only when BOTH settings triples are incomplete: (!AISAC.sendURL || !AISAC.resultURL || !AISAC.id) && (!AISAC2.sendURL || !AISAC2.resultURL || !AISAC2.id). Destination flag isDestAisac2=(AISAC.sendVehicleInfo_url==='' && AISAC2.sendVehicleInfo_url!==''); incomplete primary settings with nonempty primary sendURL do not force AISAC2.","Await getSendVehicleFolderInfomation(jsonFolderPath); jsonFileList=result.apiArgs.fileInfoList. If undefined return empty resolved file chain; otherwise sort oldest-first by new Date(lastUpdate).getTime(), comparator -1 when a<b and 1 otherwise, including equal timestamps.","For each sorted file serialize: jsonFilePath=gts.util.mergePath(folder,fileName); readFile(path); JSON.parse(json.apiArgs.data); currentVin=jsonData.reqData.vinNo. If path!==currentFilePath && isEqualVin(currentVin,vinNo), await deleteFile(path) then reject 'ignored by VIN' to skip sending.","For remaining JSON, model.checkHash(jsonData): false rejects {path:jsonFilePath,reason:'ifHash is invalid.'}; true returns replaceCtrlCharacter(jsonData,jsonFilePath). Then adjustTimeField(json,isDestAisac2); checkJsonFormat(json,gts.FORMAT_DATA.SEND_VEHICLE_INFO) must be truthy or reject. Await doSendVehicleInfo(json,isDestAisac2,jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual). On fulfilled send deleteFile(path).","Each file catch logs ignored error and resolves to continue next file; folder-info catch logs and resolves; appended folder-chain catch also logs/resolves to continue folders. Return folder chain."],"promise_and_return":"Returns promise processing folders/files sequentially; individual send cancellation/failure does not abort remaining files.","errors":"Initial getSendVehicleJsonFolderPathList rejection not caught here. All per-file and per-folder rejections swallowed. Invalid hashes/format/read/send failures retain file unless earlier duplicate delete occurred; failed delete is swallowed.","visible_effects":"Dialogs via doSendVehicleInfo.","state_mutations":"Deletes older same-VIN files before hash checks; deletes successfully processed sends after completion.","cancel_and_cleanup":"No global cancel; per-file cancellation swallowed and later queued files still run.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":188613,"end_exclusive":192832,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.sendVehicleInfo","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.sendVehicleInfo","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
  {"index":194,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.doSendVehicleInfo","inputs":"jsonData,sendToAisac2,jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual.","state_reads":"performance.now(),viewAfterRecv.","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Call model.sendVehicleInfo(jsonData,sendToAisac2,oemDecisionInfoManual). If commonResult.faultMessage truthy: contains 'ME11010' => return sendVehicleInfoSwitchToAisac2(jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual) regardless current sendToAisac2; otherwise reject {faultMessage}.","Without fault require commonResult.statusCode==='MIR2000000' or reject {statusCode}. Create deferred and startTime=performance.now(); schedule recursiveCheckResultOfSendInfo after2500ms with (controller,def,result.apiResult.ID,startTime,sendToAisac2,jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual); return def.promise().","Catch receives showDialogFunction. If typeof==='function', use that exact function; otherwise log and create fallback closure assigning screenID='Screen: S701-107\\r\\n' then returning viewAfterRecv.showDialogS701107(jsonFileName).","Await showDialog(). If clicked==='Yes', fire screenID+Yes log and return recursive doSendVehicleInfo with exact original four args. Else fire screenID+No log and reject a function ()=>Promise.reject(). For supplied dialog closures screenID remains empty; supplied closures log their own screen."],"promise_and_return":"Returns request/poll/fallback-dialog/retry chain.","errors":"Catch covers request and polling/switch failures. Error in catch-side dialog/retry is not caught again by same catch; rejection function is deliberately propagated as a value. No retry cap.","visible_effects":"S701107 fallback or supplied S701106/107 dialog.","state_mutations":"","cancel_and_cleanup":"No stops per-file queue here; caller catches propagated rejection.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":192832,"end_exclusive":194744,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.doSendVehicleInfo","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.doSendVehicleInfo","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
  {"index":195,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.recursiveCheckResultOfSendInfo","inputs":"controller,def,id,startTime,sendToAisac2,jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual.","state_reads":"performance.now().","guarded_ordered_transitions":["Await model.requestResultOfSendVehicleInfo(id,sendToAisac2,oemDecisionInfoManual). MIR2020000 is processing: if performance.now()-startTime>61000 def.reject(); else reschedule same args after2500ms. Processing branch does not inspect fault or messages.","For any nonprocessing status require MIR2000000 else def.reject(). Then if commonResult.faultMessage truthy, def.reject(showDialog closure returning showDialogS701107(jsonFileName).then to fire S701107 log and return dialog result).","Extract messages: AISAC2 uses apiResult?.responseMessageList ?? [], treating [] and exactly one entry whose responseMessage==='' as empty; otherwise map .responseMessage. NonAISAC2 uses [apiResult.responseMessage] only when truthy, else [].","If list nonempty, hasME11010=some elm.indexOf('ME11010')!==-1; responseMessage=list[0]. If hasME11010 && !sendToAisac2, return sendVehicleInfoSwitchToAisac2(jsonFileName,oemDecisionInfoManual).then(()=>def.resolve()).catch(err=>def.reject(err)). Else if !responseMessage def.resolve(); else def.reject(showDialog closure returning showDialogS701106(responseMessage,jsonFileName).then logging S701106 and returning result). Empty list=>def.resolve()."],"promise_and_return":"Returns current request chain; deferred communicates whole asynchronous polling result. Subsequent scheduled polls not awaited by current call.","errors":"Final catch logs err and def.reject() without error value, including malformed message/indexOf errors. Fault/dialog closures passed as rejection reason enable caller-selected UI.","visible_effects":"Deferred-selected S701106 or107 (not shown until caller invokes closure).","state_mutations":"","cancel_and_cleanup":"61000ms strict greater-than limit checked only on processing replies; no timer cancellation handle.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":194744,"end_exclusive":197593,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.recursiveCheckResultOfSendInfo","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.recursiveCheckResultOfSendInfo","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
  {"index":196,"symbol":"CuwController.prototype.sendInfoBeforeReprogramming","inputs":"repInfo.","state_reads":"loginMode,sentInfoBeforeRepro,vin,getWSgetHealthCheckResults().url.","guarded_ordered_transitions":["If loginMode===2 resolve before mutating flag. Else set needSendReprogrammingReport=true.","If sentInfoBeforeRepro true OR no vin OR no health-check URL resolve. Otherwise await getConfigParam(CONFIG_KEY_SEND_REP_INFO); only value==='true' && settings.url returns doSendInfoBeforeReprogramming(repInfo); otherwise resolve."],"promise_and_return":"Promise resolving skip or helper result.","errors":"No catch; config/helper rejection propagates.","visible_effects":"Downstream helper dialogs.","state_mutations":"needSendReprogrammingReport=true even when subsequent noVIN/noURL/already-sent/config-disabled skips.","cancel_and_cleanup":"No cleanup.","source":{"member":"js/cuw/controllers/cuw_controller.js","character_span":{"start":197593,"end_exclusive":198641,"coordinate":"zero-based Unicode code points after utf-8-sig decoding"}},"contract_id":"cuw.controller.sendInfoBeforeReprogramming","id":"FlashingFrontend.controller_completion.cuw.controller.sendInfoBeforeReprogramming","owner":"FlashingFrontend","source_ids":["cuw_utility.cuw-controller"]},
